# shell: tracker
# PVK-042: the clipboard chords answer in the single-window shell too,
# resolved from the same table the menus read.
wait 8
click-row 1
wait 3
key x ctrl
wait 5
click-row 0
wait 2
key Return
wait 10
key v ctrl
wait 20
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/sub/a.txt
note and a chord only the shared table knows answers too: Cmd+I here
note says honestly that this shell has no Info window
key i ctrl
wait 3
expect-status not available in this shell
quit
